[SIZE=5][B]What is Billify?[/B][/SIZE]
Inspired by the invoice systems every FiveM roleplay server uses, Billify brings proper billing to Minecraft. Police fining a speeder, a mechanic charging for repairs, a landlord collecting rent - anyone with an invoice rank can send a bill, and the player pays it from a clean GUI.

No more "pay me 500 please" in chat that nobody follows up on. Bills are tracked, visible, and collected automatically by the debt collection agency when they expire.

[SIZE=5][B]NEW: Receipt resource pack[/B][/SIZE]
Billify ships with an optional resource pack that re-skins every menu: invoices become torn paper receipts with a coloured status strip, your balance gets its own coin panel and paid bills are stamped. Players without the pack simply get the classic item menus, so nothing breaks.

