[SIZE=5][B]Features[/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*][B]Receipt resource pack[/B] - paper receipts, stamps and custom icons, sent automatically on join (optional)
[*][B]Clean invoice GUI[/B] - open and paid invoices in one menu, with a detail view per invoice
[*][B]Debt collection agency[/B] - overdue invoices get a one-time fee, reminders every 30 minutes and are collected from the balance automatically
[*][B]Configurable expiry[/B] - decide how long players have to pay
[*][B]Invoice ranks[/B] - police, mechanics, landlords... each rank with its own limit and permissions
[*][B]System invoices[/B] - create bills on behalf of a company, government or faction
[*][B]Full invoice history[/B] - view any player's open and closed invoices
[*][B]Cancel with a reason[/B] - mistakes happen, cancel any invoice
[*][B]Every text in a language file[/B] - English and Dutch included, every message and every word on the receipt is editable (hex colours supported)
[*][B]Open the menu your way[/B] - command, right-clicking an item or right-clicking a block
[*][B]Vault auto-download[/B] - Billify installs the right Vault version for you when it is missing
[/LIST]

[SIZE=5][B]Commands[/B][/SIZE]
[CODE]/invoice                                             open your invoices
/invoice create <player> <amount> <reason>           send an invoice
/invoice forcecreate <creator> <payer> <amount> <reason>   create a system invoice
/invoice view <player>                               view a player's invoices
/invoice cancel <player> <id> <reason>               cancel an invoice
/invoice help                                        show all commands[/CODE]
Aliases: /invoices, /bill, /bills, /fine, /fines, /payment

[SIZE=5][B]Permissions[/B][/SIZE]
[CODE]billify.open                  open your own invoices (default: everyone)
billify.openmenu              open the menu with the configured item/block (default: everyone)
billify.command.help          /invoice help (default: everyone)
billify.command.create        /invoice create (default: op)
billify.command.forcecreate   /invoice forcecreate (default: op)
billify.command.view          /invoice view (default: op)
billify.command.cancel        /invoice cancel (default: op)[/CODE]
Invoice ranks (limits, who may create/cancel/check) are configured in config.yml, e.g. [I]billify.police[/I].

[SIZE=5][B]Requirements[/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*][B]Vault[/B] - downloaded automatically when missing, or [URL='https://www.spigotmc.org/resources/vault.34315/']download here[/URL]
[*]An economy plugin such as Essentials, CMI or any other Vault-compatible economy
[*]Resource pack (optional): Minecraft 1.20+ clients on a 1.14+ server
[/LIST]

[SIZE=5][B]Installation[/B][/SIZE]
[LIST=1]
[*]Install an economy plugin (Vault is installed for you if needed)
[*]Drop Billify.jar in your plugins folder
[*]Start your server and edit config.yml and language_EN.yml to taste
[*]Already sending your own server resource pack? Merge [I]Billify-ResourcePack.zip[/I] (from GitHub) into it and set RESOURCE_PACK.SEND_ON_JOIN to false
[/LIST]

[SIZE=5][B]Compatibility[/B][/SIZE]
Spigot and Paper, [B]1.8 through 1.21[/B].

[SIZE=5][B]Statistics[/B][/SIZE]
Billify reports anonymous usage data through bStats, public for everyone to see: [URL='https://bstats.org/plugin/bukkit/Billify/33589']bstats.org/plugin/bukkit/Billify/33589[/URL]

